    "Home",
    "Accueil",
    "\n<section class=\"hero container\" id=\"home\" aria-labelledby=\"heroTitle\">\n  <div class=\"hero-main\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"tiny-line\"></span><span data-i18n=\"heroEyebrow\">Theoretical physics · Gravitation</span></p>\n    <h1 id=\"heroTitle\">Hasan<br>El Moumni<span class=\"title-dot\">.</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"hero-position\" data-i18n=\"heroPosition\">Full Professor · Ibn Zohr University</p>\n    <p class=\"hero-summary\" data-i18n=\"heroSummary\">Exploring black holes, the thermodynamics of spacetime, and the observational signatures of strong gravity.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"#research\"><span data-i18n=\"exploreResearch\">Explore my research</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#publications\"><span data-i18n=\"selectedPubs\">Selected publications</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div>\n    <div class=\"profile-links\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-0910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"orcid-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">iD</span> ORCID <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Hasan-El-Moumni-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ResearchGate <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n    <div class=\"portrait-frame\"><span class=\"portrait-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img src=\"assets/hasan-el-moumni.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Hasan El Moumni\" width=\"560\" height=\"700\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><span class=\"portrait-coordinate\" aria-hidden=\"true\">φ &nbsp; / &nbsp; g<sub>μν</sub></span></div>\n    <div class=\"portrait-caption\"><span class=\"location-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◦</span><div><span data-i18n=\"heroFaculty\">Faculty of Sciences</span><br><span class=\"caption-location\" data-i18n=\"heroLocation\">Agadir, Morocco</span></div><span class=\"caption-cross\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-bottom\"><p data-i18n=\"heroLab\">Laboratory of Theoretical and High Energy Physics · LPTHE</p><a href=\"#about\" class=\"scroll-cue\"><span data-i18n=\"scroll\">Discover more</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"about section\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"aboutTitle\"><div class=\"container section-grid\"><div class=\"section-side\"><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">01</span><span data-i18n=\"aboutLabel\">About</span></p><h2 id=\"aboutTitle\" data-i18n=\"aboutTitle\">Gravity, from theory<br>to observation.</h2></div><div class=\"section-body\"><p class=\"large-copy\" data-i18n=\"aboutLead\">I am a theoretical physicist and Full Professor at the Faculty of Sciences, Ibn Zohr University in Agadir, Morocco.</p><p data-i18n=\"aboutBody\">My research focuses on black-hole thermodynamics, generalized entropy and strong-gravity phenomenology. I combine analytical modelling and numerical methods to study phase structure, light propagation and particle dynamics around compact objects.</p><p data-i18n=\"aboutTeaching\">Alongside research, I teach physics at undergraduate and graduate levels and supervise doctoral work in gravitation and high-energy physics.</p><div class=\"about-facts\"><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"fieldLabel\">Field</span><span data-i18n=\"fieldValue\">Theoretical & mathematical physics</span></div><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"institutionLabel\">Institution</span><a href=\"https://www.uiz.ac.ma/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ibn Zohr University <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"identifierLabel\">Research identifier</span><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-0910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">0000-0001-7408-0910 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div><details class=\"career\"><summary><span data-i18n=\"careerLabel\">Academic background</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"career-content\"><div><span class=\"career-year\">2018</span><p data-i18n=\"careerHdr\">Habilitation to supervise research in high-energy physics, Ibn Zohr University.</p></div><div><span class=\"career-year\">2014</span><p data-i18n=\"careerPhd\">PhD in high-energy physics, Cadi Ayyad University. Research on string theory, black holes and conformal theories.</p></div><p class=\"career-source\"><span data-i18n=\"careerSource\">Academic record:</span> <a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-0910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ORCID ↗</a></p></div></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"research section\" id=\"research\" aria-labelledby=\"researchTitle\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">02</span><span data-i18n=\"researchLabel\">Research directions</span></p><h2 id=\"researchTitle\" data-i18n=\"researchTitle\">Different questions.<br>A common horizon.</h2></div><p class=\"section-intro\" data-i18n=\"researchIntro\">Understanding the links between geometry, thermodynamics and what we can observe.</p></div>\n<div class=\"research-list\">\n<article class=\"research-row\"><div class=\"research-index\">I.</div><div class=\"research-sketch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 120\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"><ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"18\"/><ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"18\" transform=\"rotate(60 80 60)\"/><ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"18\" transform=\"rotate(120 80 60)\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" r=\"27\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" r=\"40\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/></g><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#c6693e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"research-copy\"><h3 data-i18n=\"r1title\">Horizons & thermodynamics</h3><p data-i18n=\"r1body\">Black-hole phase transitions, stability and microstructure through generalized and nonextensive entropies, with particular emphasis on Rényi statistics.</p><div class=\"topic-tags\"><span>Entropy</span><span>Phase structure</span><span>Emergent gravity</span></div></div><a class=\"research-arrow\" href=\"#publications\" data-research-filter=\"thermodynamics\" aria-label=\"View publications on thermodynamics\">↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"research-row\"><div class=\"research-index\">II.</div><div class=\"research-sketch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 120\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"><ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"61\" rx=\"46\" ry=\"18\" transform=\"rotate(-24 80 61)\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"61\" r=\"22\"/><path d=\"M10 20Q65 24 67 50M10 100Q70 105 73 80M150 15Q100 40 103 61M150 100Q112 78 107 61\"/><path d=\"M12 30Q43 32 58 47M15 88Q47 87 59 76\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/></g><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"61\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#293431\"/><path d=\"M59 48A24 24 0 0 1 99 49\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c6693e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></div><div class=\"research-copy\"><h3 data-i18n=\"r2title\">Geometry & observations</h3><p data-i18n=\"r2body\">Light propagation, gravitational lensing and black-hole shadows as ways to compare spacetime models with observations of compact objects.</p><div class=\"topic-tags\"><span>Black-hole shadows</span><span>Lensing</span><span>Strong gravity</span></div></div><a class=\"research-arrow\" href=\"#publications\" data-research-filter=\"shadows\" aria-label=\"View publications on black-hole shadows\">↗</a></article>\n<article class=\"research-row\"><div class=\"research-index\">III.</div><div class=\"research-sketch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 160 120\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 61H148M25 27V96\" stroke=\"#adb1a6\"/><path d=\"M15 60C28 60 28 26 41 26S54 94 67 94S80 26 93 26S106 94 119 94S132 60 145 60\"/><path d=\"M15 60C25 60 25 43 35 43S45 77 55 77S65 43 75 43S85 77 95 77S105 43 115 43S125 77 135 77S140 60 147 60\" stroke=\"#c6693e\"/></g></svg></div><div class=\"research-copy\"><h3 data-i18n=\"r3title\">Dynamics & timing</h3><p data-i18n=\"r3body\">Charged-particle motion and oscillations near magnetized black holes, linking theoretical frequency models to quasi-periodic oscillations through Bayesian inference.</p><div class=\"topic-tags\"><span>QPOs</span><span>Magnetic fields</span><span>Bayesian inference</span></div></div><a class=\"research-arrow\" href=\"#publications\" data-research-filter=\"qpo\" aria-label=\"View publications on quasi-periodic oscillations\">↗</a></article>\n</div><p class=\"sketch-note\" data-i18n=\"sketchNote\">Schematic illustrations of research themes.</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"publications section\" id=\"publications\" aria-labelledby=\"publicationsTitle\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">03</span><span data-i18n=\"publicationsLabel\">Selected work</span></p><h2 id=\"publicationsTitle\" data-i18n=\"publicationsTitle\">Research in print.</h2></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-0910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-i18n=\"fullRecord\">Full publication record on ORCID</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"publications-toolbar\"><div class=\"filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter publications\"><button class=\"filter active\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-i18n=\"filterAll\">All topics</button><button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"thermodynamics\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i18n=\"filterThermo\">Thermodynamics</button><button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"shadows\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-i18n=\"filterShadows\">Shadows</button><button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"qpo\" aria-pressed=\"false\">QPOs</button></div><span class=\"publication-count\" id=\"publicationCount\" role=\"status\">6 publications</span></div><div id=\"publicationList\" class=\"publication-list\"></div><noscript><p>Selected publications: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1103/mnm4-mylh\">Modified Unruh thermodynamics (2026)</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dark.2026.102311\">QPO-based Bayesian constraints (2026)</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2025.117239\">Rényi microstructure (2026)</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1140/epjc/s10052-025-14830-6\">HF-QPOs with CDM halos (2025)</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dark.2024.101731\">Accelerating black-hole shadows (2025)</a>; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aop.2024.169679\">Born–Infeld-AdS topology (2024)</a>.</p></noscript><div class=\"publications-bottom\"><p data-i18n=\"selectionNote\">A thematic selection, rather than an exhaustive bibliography.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"assets/selected-publications.bib\" download><span data-i18n=\"downloadBib\">Download BibTeX</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"teaching section\" id=\"teaching\" aria-labelledby=\"teachingTitle\" lang=\"fr\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">04</span><span>Enseignement & transmission</span></p><h2 id=\"teachingTitle\">Comprendre la physique.<br>Apprendre à la pratiquer.</h2></div><p class=\"section-intro\">Des cours fondamentaux aux premières investigations, un espace pour les étudiants de licence et de master.</p></div><div class=\"teaching-layout\"><div class=\"course-list\"><details class=\"course\"><summary><span class=\"course-name\"><span class=\"course-level\">Licence · S5</span><span>Physique statistique</span></span><span class=\"course-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"course-content\"><p>Probabilités, espace des phases, ensembles microcanonique, canonique et grand canonique, statistiques quantiques.</p><a href=\"https://helmoumni.weebly.com/teaching.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-link\">Supports, TD et annales — archives <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></details><details class=\"course\"><summary><span class=\"course-name\"><span class=\"course-level\">Master</span><span>Relativité générale & cosmologie</span></span><span class=\"course-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"course-content\"><p>Géométrie de l’espace-temps, équations d’Einstein, solutions de trous noirs et modèles cosmologiques.</p><a href=\"https://helmoumni.weebly.com/teaching.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-link\">Cours et diaporamas — archives <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></details><details class=\"course\"><summary><span class=\"course-name\"><span class=\"course-level\">Licence</span><span>Mécanique & démarche expérimentale</span></span><span class=\"course-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"course-content\"><p>Cinématique, dynamique, oscillations et analyse des mesures. Une première ressource interactive permet de travailler le pendule simple.</p><a href=\"teaching/pendule.html\" class=\"text-link\">Explorer le chapitre pilote <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></details><p class=\"archive-note\">Les liens d’archives renvoient aux supports déjà diffusés. Pour les consignes et documents de la séance en cours, contactez-moi.</p></div><article class=\"book-card\"><div class=\"book-card-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Le livre laboratoire</span><span class=\"prototype-badge\">Prototype</span></div><div class=\"pendulum-drawing\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 250 145\"><path d=\"M126 15V130\" stroke=\"#839085\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\"/><path d=\"M86 22H164\" stroke=\"#263a31\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M126 22L170 112\" stroke=\"#263a31\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M77 111A100 100 0 0 0 173 112\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a9b1a2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"112\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#c6693e\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"22\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#263a31\"/><text x=\"144\" y=\"67\" fill=\"#6e7b6c\" font-family=\"Georgia\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"15\">L</text></svg></div><p class=\"book-chapter\">Chapitre 01 · Mécanique</p><h3>Mesurer la gravité.</h3><p>Un pendule, un protocole à concevoir et des données à interpréter. Simulation non linéaire, incertitudes et estimation de g.</p><a class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"teaching/pendule.html\">Entrer dans le laboratoire <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"book-note\">Licence S1–S2 · Chapitre pilote</span></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"contact section\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contactTitle\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"contact-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">05</span><span data-i18n=\"contactLabel\">Get in touch</span></p><h2 id=\"contactTitle\" data-i18n=\"contactTitle\">Let’s discuss physics.</h2><p class=\"contact-copy\" data-i18n=\"contactCopy\">For research discussions, academic collaborations or questions about teaching, you can reach me at my university address.</p><a class=\"email-link\" href=\"mailto:h.elmoumni@uiz.ac.ma\">h.elmoumni@uiz.ac.ma <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"copy-email\" id=\"copyEmail\" data-i18n=\"copyEmail\">Copy email address</button></div><div class=\"contact-address\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" data-i18n=\"basedAt\">Based at</span><p data-i18n=\"contactAddress\">Department of Physics<br>Faculty of Sciences<br>Ibn Zohr University<br>Agadir, Morocco</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.uiz.ac.ma/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-i18n=\"universityWebsite\">University website</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>\n"
