    "<section class=\"about section\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"aboutTitle\"><div class=\"container section-grid\"><div class=\"section-side\"><p class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"section-number\">01</span><span data-i18n=\"aboutLabel\">About</span></p><h2 id=\"aboutTitle\" data-i18n=\"aboutTitle\">Gravity, from theory<br>to observation.</h2></div><div class=\"section-body\"><p class=\"large-copy\" data-i18n=\"aboutLead\">I am a theoretical physicist and Full Professor at the Faculty of Sciences, Ibn Zohr University in Agadir, Morocco.</p><p data-i18n=\"aboutBody\">My research focuses on black-hole thermodynamics, generalized entropy and strong-gravity phenomenology. I combine analytical modelling and numerical methods to study phase structure, light propagation and particle dynamics around compact objects.</p><p data-i18n=\"aboutTeaching\">Alongside research, I teach physics at undergraduate and graduate levels and supervise doctoral work in gravitation and high-energy physics.</p><div class=\"about-facts\"><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"fieldLabel\">Field</span><span data-i18n=\"fieldValue\">Theoretical & mathematical physics</span></div><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"institutionLabel\">Institution</span><a href=\"https://www.uiz.ac.ma/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ibn Zohr University <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div><span class=\"fact-label\" data-i18n=\"identifierLabel\">Research identifier</span><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7408-0910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">0000-0001-7408-0910 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div><details class=\"career\"><summary><span data-i18n=\"careerLabel\">Academic background</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"career-content\"><div><span class=\"career-year\">2018</span><p data-i18n=\"careerHdr\">Habilitation to supervise research in high-energy physics, Ibn Zohr University.</p></div><div><span class=\"career-year\">2014<